<title>JAPAN: Ichikawa Woolen -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ichikawa Woolen -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.93		vs	    7.61</p>
<p> Operating	  706    million    vs	  624    million</p>
<p> Current	    643    million    vs	  549    million</p>
<p> Net		  292    million    vs	  572    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.21 yen	  vs	   16.05 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     36 million	  vs	  36 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Ichikawa Woolen Textile Co Ltd makes felt for paper manufacturing.</p>
</text>
